nghttp2 1.70.0 (https://github.com/nghttp2/nghttp2), the library lib/ only: the HTTP/2
frames, HPACK and streams of tz:http and fetch. Taken from the release tarball; nghttp2ver.h
is the one its CMake build generates. One change: the runtime linker of tz takes no
non-constant static variables, so two are global with names of their own —
mem_default in nghttp2_mem.c is nghttp2_mem_default_value, version in nghttp2_version.c is
nghttp2_version_value.
